course: dictionary
lesson: 13242
title: Sorting living things: genus
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A genus is a group of living things that are closely related. Scientists use it as one step when they sort life into groups, from the very big groups down to the smallest ones.
explain: The steps go kingdom, phylum, class, order, family, genus, species. Each step is more exact than the one before it. A genus sits just above species, so it groups together the species that are most alike.
explain: Scientific names have two parts. «Panthera leo» is the name for a lion: Panthera is the genus, and leo is the species. The genus always comes first, starts with a capital letter, and is written in italics.
explain: Outside science, genus can mean any kind or class of things. Context helps here: if a teacher says, «Poems are one genus of writing», she means poems are one type of writing, not a living thing at all.
fact: A genus is a group of closely related species.
fact: «Homo sapiens» is the scientific name for humans: Homo is the genus, and sapiens is the species.
fact: «Panthera leo» is the scientific name for a lion; the genus is Panthera.
fact: The plural of genus is genera.
fact: A genus name starts with a capital letter and is written in italics; the species name is written in small letters.
exercise: The scientific name «Panthera leo» belongs to a lion. Which word is the genus? | *Panthera | Lion | Leo | Species
exercise: In the steps for sorting living things, which step comes just before species? | Order | Kingdom | *Genus | Family
exercise: The word genus can also mean what? | The smallest living part of a cell | *Any kind or class of things | A number used in maths | A single animal on its own
test: In the scientific name «Homo sapiens», which word is the genus? | Human | Species | *Homo | Sapiens
test: What is the plural of genus? | Genuses | *Genera | Genes | Genuss
exam: Which statement about a genus is true? | It is a smaller step than species | *It is a step in sorting life that sits just above species | It is a single living thing | It is always written in capital letters and bold type
